    <item>
      <title>Contact</title>
      <link>/contact/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 13:04:00 -0400</pubDate>
      
      <guid>/contact/</guid>
      <description>Find the tunnel Address: 412 Vine Tunnel, Suite 0
Hours: Daily 11am – 11pm
Phone: (555) 010-0000
Walk-ins welcome. Large groups: call ahead so the belt stays clear.
Say something Questions, catering, or a pie that failed your personal compile — call the number above. We answer when the oven isn’t screaming.</description>
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>About</title>
      <link>/about/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 13:03:58 -0400</pubDate>
      
      <guid>/about/</guid>
      <description>Built for the tunnel Tunnel Test Pizzeria runs one long oven. Dough goes in. Pie comes out. If the crust doesn’t set, it doesn’t leave the belt.
We keep the menu short on purpose — margherita that exits clean, pepperoni that loops, specials that refuse the wrong toppings.
For the love of food Patterns and requests can describe a pie. Only a mouth can love one. We fire for the second case.</description>
    </item>
    
